		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>You gently lift an ally into the air to carry them with you as you channel the wind to follow you.</em></p><p><strong>Once Per Turn</strong> - 1 Ally (5 ft.) - Magical</p><p>When you use the @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.UMZY7HTxI0EvRjsT]{Step of the Wind} feature:</p><ul><li><p>You can carry an ally with you. Your ally follows directly behind you while you move.</p></li><li><p>When you stop moving, your ally is placed directly behind you.</p></li><li><p>If you start moving again during the same turn, you can choose to move the same ally with you again.</p></li></ul>",
			"chat": ""
		},
